  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Updates fighter X for one frame: hit test, input, input fix-ups, move state, animation, end of animation, sprite priority. Called from the bout loop."},
    {"at":18,"placement":"side","text":"Reading $d01e also clears it"},
    {"at":23,"placement":"side","text":"Sprites touch: keep the priority"},
    {"at":27,"placement":"side","text":"Move $11: the opponent goes in front"},
    {"at":31,"placement":"side","text":"Attack move: this fighter goes in front"},
    {"at":44,"placement":"line","text":"Sets fighter_input,x: the hit reaction when the fighter is hit, else the AI or the joystick. Called from fighter_update."},
    {"at":63,"placement":"side","text":"Port A as input for the read"},
    {"at":66,"placement":"side","text":"$dc00 port 2 for fighter 0, $dc01 port 1 for fighter 1"},
    {"at":72,"placement":"side","text":"Port A as output again (keyboard scan)"},
    {"at":79,"placement":"side","text":"Facing left: swap left and right"},
    {"at":100,"placement":"line","text":"Move for each joystick value AND $1f (bits low = pressed: 0 up, 1 down, 2 left, 3 right, 4 fire), written for facing right."},
    {"at":132,"placement":"line","text":"Move state machine: changes fighter_move,x from fighter_input,x. Handles hit reactions, the crouch before low moves, the about turn and the back kick, and the retract of held moves."},
    {"at":142,"placement":"side","text":"Hit reactions $16, $1a, $1b"},
    {"at":152,"placement":"side","text":"Freeze the pose until the delay ends"},
    {"at":184,"placement":"side","text":"Back kick input: start with the about turn $12"},
    {"at":193,"placement":"side","text":"Moves $07, $10, $0a start from a crouch"},
    {"at":235,"placement":"side","text":"Crouch must hold its end pose"},
    {"at":267,"placement":"side","text":"About turn complete: back kick $11"},
    {"at":284,"placement":"side","text":"Back kick ended: return with move $15 backwards"},
    {"at":303,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 7: switch at once, 0: retract, 1: run to the end"},
    {"at":334,"placement":"line","text":"Acts when the animation of fighter X ended: a hit reaction ends the bout, a retract returns to stand or crouch, a hold move keeps its end pose ($69)."},
    {"at":346,"placement":"side","text":"Ends the bout loop"},
    {"at":355,"placement":"side","text":"Back kick retracted: the fighter now faces the other way"},
    {"at":377,"placement":"side","text":"Low moves retract into the crouch, then rise"},
    {"at":396,"placement":"side","text":"0 = hold the end pose"},
    {"at":429,"placement":"side","text":"Start the crouch animation backwards"},
    {"at":433,"placement":"line","text":"Changes fighter_input,x before the state machine. Back during an opponent attack in range becomes the matching block; down-forward from a stand becomes move $18."},
    {"at":441,"placement":"side","text":"Already blocking: keep the block"},
    {"at":468,"placement":"side","text":"Sweeps are not blocked"},
    {"at":492,"placement":"side","text":"Block $13 or $14 for the opponent move"},
    {"at":512,"placement":"side","text":"Down-forward outside a crouch: move $18"},
    {"at":517,"placement":"line","text":"Selects anim_number,x from fighter_move,x: a new move starts its animation, a held pose stops it, else it runs on. Then steps the animation at $3026."}
  ],
